Q6 — Rotate Matrix 90° Clockwise
You are given an n X n square matrix of integers.
Rotate the matrix by 90 degrees clockwise in-place.
You must modify the original matrix directly instead of creating another matrix to store the result.
Return the rotated matrix.
Examples
Input 1:
matrix = [
[1, 2],
[3, 4]
Output 1:
(3, 11,
(4,2)
]
